&INFO
Si64, 2x2x2 of Si8, LDA, 25 Ry, gamma, forces and stress
&END
&CPMD
 OPTIMIZE WAVEFUNCTION
 INITIALIZE WAVEFUNCTION ATOMS
 CONVERGENCE ORBITALS
  1.0d-12
 MAXSTEP
  5
 PRINT FORCES ON
 STRESS TENSOR
  1
&END
&DFT
 FUNCTIONAL LDA
&END
&SYSTEM
 SYMMETRY
  1
 CELL
  20.52 1.0 1.0 0.0 0.0 0.0
 CUTOFF
  25
&END
